NOTE ON THE DATA

The MIT license above covers the source code of this repository only. No
dataset is distributed here: `scripts/fetch_datasets.py` downloads each one
from its own public repository and rebuilds the derivation used in the paper.
Those datasets carry the terms of their sources; see `docs/datasets.md` for the
source, licence and citation of each one.
